<section class="film film-mitty" id="mitty">
  <div class="film-bg-glow"></div>
  <div class="film-inner">
    <div class="film-poster-wrap reveal">
      <div class="poster-frame">
        <span class="year-tag">2013</span>
        <img src="http://www.impawards.com/2013/posters/secret_life_of_walter_mitty_ver4.jpg" alt="The Secret Life of Walter Mitty poster" loading="lazy"/>
        <div class="rating"><span class="rating-stars">★★★★</span><span class="rating-num">7.3</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="poster-caption">Dir. Ben Stiller · Fox 2000 Pictures · Design: Midnight Oil</p>
    </div>
    <div class="film-text">
      <span class="film-label reveal">Film One · Adventure</span>
      <h2 class="film-title reveal">THE SECRET<br>LIFE OF<br><em>WALTER MITTY</em></h2>
      <p class="film-director reveal">Directed by Ben Stiller</p>
      <p class="film-synopsis reveal">Walter Mitty is a negative assets manager at LIFE Magazine who daydreams his way through a life he's too afraid to actually live. When a crucial photo negative goes missing, he's forced out of his head and into the world — across Greenland, Iceland, and Afghanistan — discovering that the life he imagined was smaller than the one waiting for him.</p>
      <p class="film-synopsis reveal">It's a film about the courage it takes to stop dreaming and start moving. Stiller wraps that idea in some of the most stunning landscape cinematography of the decade, set to a score that makes you want to buy a one-way ticket somewhere cold.</p>
      <div class="film-quote reveal">"To see the world, things dangerous to come to, to see behind walls, to draw closer, to find each other and to feel. That is the purpose of life."</div>
      <div class="film-pills reveal">
        <span class="pill">Ben Stiller</span><span class="pill">Kristen Wiig</span>
        <span class="pill">Sean Penn</span><span class="pill">Iceland</span><span class="pill">116 min</span>
      </div>
      <div class="film-credits reveal reveal-late">
        <div class="credit"><span class="credit-label">Director</span><span class="credit-val">Ben Stiller</span></div>
        <div class="credit"><span class="credit-label">Screenplay</span><span class="credit-val">Steve Conrad</span></div>
        <div class="credit"><span class="credit-label">Cinematography</span><span class="credit-val">Stuart Dryburgh</span></div>
        <div class="credit"><span class="credit-label">Music</span><span class="credit-val">Theodore Shapiro</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

